### 2. The Service Implementation (Optimized Logic)

**File:** `com.tcs.fincore.CommonMasterService.service.CommonMasterServiceImpl.java`

We use `objectMapper.readTree()` so the "String" from the DB is treated as a "Live Object" by the API.

```java
@Override
@Transactional
public Object getOrGenerateLhoSummary(Long id) {
    log.info("Fetching LHO Summary for ID: {}", id);

    // 1. Check Cache Table (LHO_TRANSFER_SUMMARY)
    Optional<LhoTransferSummary> cached = lhoSummaryRepository.findById(id);
    if (cached.isPresent()) {
        try {
            // Convert the CLOB string to a JSON Node so it's not returned as a quoted string
            return objectMapper.readTree(cached.get().getPayload());
        } catch (Exception e) {
            return cached.get().getPayload(); 
        }
    }

    // 2. Cache Miss: DB Aggregation (Fastest for 20k+ rows)
    log.info("Generating aggregation from P_L_TRANSFER...");
    List<Object[]> results = plTransferRepository.getAggregatedSummary();
    
    if (results.isEmpty()) {
        return Collections.emptyMap();
    }

    // 3. Transform to Map
    Map<String, Double> summaryMap = new HashMap<>();
    for (Object[] row : results) {
        summaryMap.put(String.valueOf(row[0]), ((Number) row[1]).doubleValue());
    }

    try {
        // 4. Convert to JSON String for Database Storage
        String jsonPayload = objectMapper.writeValueAsString(summaryMap);

        // 5. Save to LHO_TRANSFER_SUMMARY
        LhoTransferSummary newSummary = LhoTransferSummary.builder()
                .id(id)
                .payload(jsonPayload)
                .build();
        lhoSummaryRepository.save(newSummary);

        // Return the Map directly (Spring will convert it to a real JSON object)
        return summaryMap;
        
    } catch (Exception e) {
        log.error("Serialization error", e);
        throw new RuntimeException("Failed to process summary");
    }
}

```

