### 3. The Controller (Refined)

**File:** `com.tcs.fincore.CommonMasterService.Controller.LhoTransferController.java`
By using `Object` in the `ApiResponse`, we ensure the data is sent as a proper JSON object `{}`.

```java
@GetMapping("/summary/{id}")
public ResponseEntity<ApiResponse<Object>> getSummary(@PathVariable Long id) {
    log.info("API Request: Summary for ID {}", id);
    Object data = service.getOrGenerateLhoSummary(id);
    return ResponseEntity.ok(ApiResponse.success(data, "Summary retrieved successfully"));
}

```

